{"id":"9fbacb16db1e028f","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-WKL0-conservative.md","title":"Pi-One-One Conservativity of WKL0 over RCA0","display":"thm-WKL0-conservative — Pi-One-One Conservativity of WKL0 over RCA0","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-WKL0-conservative","aliases":["62-thm-WKL0-conservative"],"display":"thm-WKL0-conservative — Pi-One-One Conservativity of WKL0 over RCA0","depends_on":["[[62-df-WKL0]]","[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-L2]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem IX.2.1; Corollary IX.2.6","source_pages":[365,368],"source_pdf_pages":[383,386]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-WKL0-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-WKL0-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-WKL0-conservative — Pi-One-One Conservativity of WKL0 over RCA0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem IX.2.1; Corollary IX.2.6"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>365</span><span>368</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>383</span><span>386</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1(S_2)\">\\(\\Pi^1_1(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a>，句子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>；Conservative 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL0\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Conservative}_{\\Pi^1_1(S_2)\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}WKL0\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Conservative}_{\\Pi^1_1(S_2)\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}}(\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>IX.2.1 将任意可数 RCA₀ 模型扩成具有相同数域、更多集合的 WKL₀ 模型。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\bar X\\theta(\\bar X)\">\\(\\forall\\bar X\\theta(\\bar X)\\)</span> 在原模型失败，原集合域内的一组反例参数仍留在扩充模型中；θ 算术，数域与旧集合的成员关系不变，故仍失败。结合双类一阶完备性与健全性得结论。这里的“ω-submodel”指保持同一数域，数域可以非标准；不能只证明标准 ω 模型扩充就宣称全部语法保守性。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem IX.2.1; Corollary IX.2.6；纸面页 365, 368；PDF 页 383, 386。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-WKL0","status":"resolved","id":"87afe420a89e1fce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-WKL0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WKL0","status":"resolved","id":"87afe420a89e1fce","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-WKL0]]、[[62-df-RCA0]]；$\\Pi^1_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]，句子见 [[62-df-L2]]；Conservative 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","ex